Source: steam-trailer-screensaver
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Steam Trailer Screensaver Project <noreply@example.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, qt6-base-dev, libmpv-dev, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.0

Package: steam-trailer-screensaver
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xscreensaver, libmpv2 (>= 0.35), yt-dlp
Description: Steam game trailers as an xscreensaver hack
 Plays streamed Steam store trailers (with a YouTube fallback for games
 with no Steam-hosted trailer) as a classic xscreensaver hack, filterable
 by genre and age rating. X11 only — see /usr/share/doc/steam-trailer-screensaver/LIMITATIONS
 for why GNOME/Wayland isn't supported.
